{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-99-park-place","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"99-park-place","about":"Welcome to the pinnacle of luxurious living at 99 Park Place by Tabeer, a signature address in Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) that redefines the essence of sophistication and comfort. At 99 Park Place Dubai, we offer an exclusive collection of 99 residences, each designed to embody the ultimate in luxury, functionality, and exclusivity. From sleek residential studios to spacious two-bedroom apartments, every home at 99 Park Place JVC is a masterpiece of designer interiors, fully equipped kitchens, and first-class amenities, ensuring that every aspect of your life is immersed in luxury.Luxury at 99 Park Place by Tabeer in JVC is not just about aesthetic appeal; it is a comprehensive experience that enhances your daily life. The thoughtful design, luxurious finishes, and meticulous attention to detail at 99 Park Place ensure that every corner serves as a peaceful retreat. The project's modern architectural solutions, combined with high-quality materials, create an environment of unmatched sophistication and warmth.99 Park Place Dubai is not just a residence; it is a lifestyle destination where convenience, comfort, and elegance are woven into the fabric of everyday life. The 99 Park Place Location is strategically chosen to offer residents an unparalleled living experience, combining the tranquility of suburban living with the convenience of city life. The 99 Park Place Payment plans are tailored to offer flexibility and accessibility, making it easier for you to own a piece of this luxurious project.At 99 Park Place JVC (Jumeirah Village Circle), every detail is meticulously planned to ensure that your home is not just a place to live, but a sanctuary of elegance and tranquility. Whether it's the panoramic views from your apartment, the lush landscapes that surround the buildings, or the state-of-the-art amenities, 99 Park Place by Tabeer is designed to elevate your living experience to new heights of luxury and comfort.","price":630000,"title":"99 Park Place","bitrix":{"id":358,"pf_id":"are.2.13683","source":null,"project_id":"99 Park Place","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"99 Parkplace","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Tabeer","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_feature_1802a00eb5.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_feature_1802a00eb5.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0587851,"lng":55.196774},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_1_519f01572d.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_1_519f01572d.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_2_a4bca89bf3.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_2_a4bca89bf3.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_3_76f612ffc8.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_3_76f612ffc8.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_feature_1802a00eb5.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_feature_1802a00eb5.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_1_519f01572d.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_1_519f01572d.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_2_a4bca89bf3.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/99park_place_2_a4bca89bf3.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/99park_place_3_76f612ffc8.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x3